* Encoding: UTF-8.

DATASET ACTIVATE ConjuntoDatos1.
* ANÁLISIS DESCRIPTIVO PARA VARIABLES CATEGÓRICAS.
* GRÁFICO: De barras. 

CODEBOOK  P69_1 [n] P69_1_T [s] P69_1_M [s] P69_1_H [s] P69_2 [n] P69_2_T [s] P69_2_M [s] P69_2_H 
    [s] VFI_P70 [n] P70_1 [n] P70A_1_1 [s] P70A_1_2 [s] P70A_1_3 [n] P70A_1_4 [s]
  /VARINFO POSITION LABEL TYPE FORMAT MEASURE ROLE VALUELABELS MISSING ATTRIBUTES
  /OPTIONS VARORDER=VARLIST SORT=ASCENDING MAXCATS=200
  /STATISTICS COUNT PERCENT MEAN STDDEV QUARTILES.

FREQUENCIES VARIABLES=P70_1 P70_2 P70A_3_2 P70_7 P70A_10_1 P71_1 P72A_1 P73_1_1
  /BARCHART FREQ
  /ORDER=ANALYSIS.

* ANÁLISIS DESCRIPTIVO PARA VARIABLES NUMÉRICAS. 
* GRÁFICO: Histogramas, con curva normal.

FREQUENCIES VARIABLES=P69_1_T P70A_1_1 P70A_1_2
  /FORMAT=NOTABLE
  /NTILES=4
  /NTILES=10
  /STATISTICS=STDDEV VARIANCE RANGE MINIMUM MAXIMUM SEMEAN MEAN MEDIAN MODE SKEWNESS SESKEW 
    KURTOSIS SEKURT
  /HISTOGRAM NORMAL
  /ORDER=ANALYSIS.

* Explorando cruces entre variables numéricas y categóricas.

EXAMINE VARIABLES=P69_2_T P70A_1_1
  /PLOT BOXPLOT HISTOGRAM
  /COMPARE GROUPS
  /MESTIMATORS HUBER(1.339) ANDREW(1.34) HAMPEL(1.7,3.4,8.5) TUKEY(4.685)
  /PERCENTILES(5,10,25,50,75,90,95) HAVERAGE
  /STATISTICS DESCRIPTIVES EXTREME
  /CINTERVAL 95
  /MISSING LISTWISE
  /NOTOTAL.


